Z||000010||Phaeton||04-15-2000||02:06 PM||||I bought the Fieroshop clutch.  $400US for clutch, pressure plate, throwout bearing, and pilot tool.  I haven't installed it yet, but it does look well built, and I have gone through a few clutches before.<BR>I keep my engine at max torque RPM by slipping the clutch instead of spinning the tires when accelerating from a stop.  So come June this clutch will be torture tested by a certified clutch killer.  Will post results, good or bad.  ||||reg||12
